 AM1 EXTENDED MEMORY LOADER
 / Data format
 / Any number of blocks:
 /
 / ctl word
 / if loading, followed by
 / end address + 1
 / data word
 / ... end address + 1 - start address total data words
 /
 / ctl word is:
 / dds sss sss sss sss sss
 / where:
 / dd 00 load data starting at address ssssssssssssssss
 / dd 10 start, execute jmp i ssssssssssssssss, terminates loading
 / dd 11 no start, just halt, terminates loading, used for multiple tape loads
 / REMEMBER there must be tabs in front of macro comments.

7751/
    eem
loop, rpb
    dio addr
    spi
    jmp done
    rpb
    dio end
load, rpb
    dio i addr
    idx addr
    sas end
    jmp load
    jmp loop
done, ril 1s
    spi i
    jmp i addr	/ start prog
    hlt		/ nostart, just halt
    jmp loop	/ and go again
addr, 0
end, 0
start 7751
